OL,5,G1730 Welsh Wonders (Sir Tom Jones)
OL,6,     FThe greatest moments from Tiger
OL,7,     FTom's stellar career, with
OL,8,     Fincredible finds from the BBC
OL,9,     FArchive. Enjoy two hours of
OL,10,     Fbrilliant BBC interviews and
OL,11,     Fclassic live sessions.
OL,12,G1900 Bethan Elfyn
OL,13,     FBethan plays a brilliant new and
OL,14,     Fclassic tunes, including new Welsh
OL,15,     Fmusic in The Wales Mix, and Three
OL,16,     Fof a Kind from Scotland.
OL,17,G2100 BBC Introducing with Adam Walton
OL,18,     FAdam shares this weeks gig guide
OL,19,     Ffor Wales. Georgia Ruth goes
OL,20,     Fbehind the track with her current
OL,21,     Fsingle 'Suddenly Surburbia'. Plus,
OL,22,     FThe New Breed debuts on the show.
